{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["And she called his name Yosef — because she said: אסף אלהים את חרפתי. If so, why did she not call him Asaf? The yod of יוסף — why? Because she prayed: יוסף ה' לי בן אחר. Thus this name serves two meanings: אסף and יוסף."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:44.558346221Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}